   E*(equilateral)          = +3.000000   (closed form: 3)
   E*(chain)                = +2.738376   (closed form: +2.738376)
   E*(120° isosceles)       = +2.882217   (closed form: 3 + 3ln2 − 2ln3 = +2.882217)

B. The relaxed flattening path (junction interior until 120°)
   apex θ     E*(θ)      junction
     60.0°  +3.000000   interior
